WEBVTT

00:12.012 --> 00:13.596
BALLAD OF THE HAPPY DESTRUCTION

00:20.020 --> 00:21.938
Another perk of our new recruits,

00:22.480 --> 00:25.191
we're finally able to distribute
some free meals.

00:25.692 --> 00:27.861
We don't even have to sell Black Powder,

00:27.944 --> 00:31.281
we have more than enough support from
the wealth of this mansion.

00:32.449 --> 00:34.534
The boss still hasn't come back yet, huh?

00:34.617 --> 00:37.162
No, but it seems Ton and Natsuki have
come back.

00:37.245 --> 00:38.496
They've called a meeting,

00:38.580 --> 00:41.166
'cause apparently they've got
something to show us.

00:46.671 --> 00:47.505
Hah!

00:50.633 --> 00:52.594
Amazing! There's not a scratch on her!

00:53.094 --> 00:54.679
That's defense magic for you.

00:55.180 --> 00:57.515
We may have lost Kikurage to
the En family,

00:58.016 --> 00:59.642
but when she was injured during the
battle,

00:59.726 --> 01:01.770
Natsuki's Magic was awakened.

01:02.312 --> 01:04.105
This thing is like a protective suit,

01:04.189 --> 01:06.357
it may even be able to repel Magic.

01:06.858 --> 01:07.942
Yeah!

01:08.026 --> 01:09.402
Let's try it next time!

01:09.486 --> 01:10.528
Hang on,

01:10.612 --> 01:12.989
so if Natsuki can use Magic as amazing
as this,

01:13.490 --> 01:16.409
then, there's no need for her
to stay with the Cross-Eyes.

01:16.993 --> 01:19.788
She can make a good living with
this power, y'know.

01:19.871 --> 01:22.082
Now that you mention it, you have a
point.

01:28.713 --> 01:30.381
Natsuki... your left eye!

01:30.924 --> 01:33.510
After we returned to the mansion
and healed my arm,

01:34.177 --> 01:36.179
I got this eye tattooed as well.

01:38.640 --> 01:39.474
Listen guys,

01:40.350 --> 01:41.976
even if I can use Magic now,

01:42.060 --> 01:44.395
I'll always be a member of the
Cross-Eyes!

01:46.439 --> 01:47.273
Natsuki...

01:48.274 --> 01:50.652
Yeah, that's just the way I feel about it.

01:51.152 --> 01:52.153
Whaddya say?

01:52.237 --> 01:53.738
I stay here in the mansion?

01:54.239 --> 01:56.116
Yes, of course you can!

01:56.199 --> 01:59.744
After all, if things get bad, we might
need you around to protect us!

02:00.245 --> 02:01.496
You- you mean it?

02:03.123 --> 02:04.249
Starting today,

02:04.332 --> 02:06.626
you're a full-fledged member of
the Cross-Eyes.

02:06.709 --> 02:08.002
Thanks Saji.

02:09.045 --> 02:11.631
Thanks everyone! I won't let you down.

03:40.803 --> 03:42.972
THE BEGINNING

03:47.727 --> 03:48.561
This is crazy.

03:48.645 --> 03:51.981
I never thought I'd come back to this
mansion, let alone as a man.

03:53.149 --> 03:55.902
I gotta say, you're pretty handsome like
this, Nikaido.

03:57.779 --> 03:59.989
You look like a completely different
person.

04:01.866 --> 04:04.786
By the way, these clothes are really
heavy.

04:05.787 --> 04:07.872
I used magic to make 'em that way.

04:07.956 --> 04:09.874
Your training is still ongoing.

04:10.875 --> 04:11.709
Also,

04:11.793 --> 04:14.671
the Magic that powers this disguise
only lasts four hours

04:15.672 --> 04:18.299
After that, you're gonna return to
your original form,

04:18.383 --> 04:19.676
so be careful.

04:20.927 --> 04:21.761
Understood.

04:22.262 --> 04:23.179
Four hours...

04:24.013 --> 04:25.223
So, around nine o'clock.

04:28.977 --> 04:31.938
A fellow devil once told me something
that could help us.

04:32.814 --> 04:36.192
Apparently, somewhere in this mansion,
there's a room filled solely

04:36.276 --> 04:38.736
with the gifts En received from Devils.

04:39.737 --> 04:41.114
Does that ring any bells?

04:43.658 --> 04:45.243
Now that you mention it,

04:45.326 --> 04:48.955
This one time, En took me to a strange
room and made me listen to him brag

04:49.038 --> 04:50.164
about how cool it was.

04:50.707 --> 04:52.458
Maybe that's the room you're
talking about.

04:52.542 --> 04:56.004
If I remember correctly, some kind
of object served as a hidden door.

04:57.964 --> 05:00.675
Hmm... Alright, let's go look for it.

05:05.013 --> 05:08.141
Was this room also used by an En Family
officer?

05:08.641 --> 05:10.184
Yeah, this was Noi's room.

05:11.019 --> 05:12.770
Look for anything of monetary value.

05:12.854 --> 05:14.605
Enough with the money already.

05:15.189 --> 05:17.150
So we're looking for information, right?

05:17.233 --> 05:20.445
A clue to where the surviving En Family
members might be hiding?

05:20.987 --> 05:23.197
- Hmm...
- There sure are a lot of photos.

05:25.408 --> 05:26.534
When the boss gets back,

05:26.617 --> 05:28.703
let's take a group photo together!

05:28.786 --> 05:29.954
Yeah!

05:30.621 --> 05:32.206
I can't wait to put it up here!

05:39.213 --> 05:43.009
Well, well, well, if it isn't the
Cross-Eyes B-squad. It's been a while.

05:43.968 --> 05:44.969
R-Risu?!

05:45.803 --> 05:49.807
It's a good thing I held off
erasing these damn tattoos off my face.

05:49.891 --> 05:51.476
I got in here easily.

05:52.352 --> 05:55.104
Now, maybe you've had enough time
to jog your memories.

05:55.855 --> 05:58.191
Risu, it's like I told you before,

05:58.274 --> 06:00.485
none of us have any idea who
murdered you.

06:01.486 --> 06:02.320
Hmm...

06:02.820 --> 06:03.654
Yeah?

06:03.738 --> 06:07.575
Then maybe your beloved Dokuga is
hiding a few things from you guys.

06:09.744 --> 06:12.872
Because he seemed to know a lot about me.

06:14.791 --> 06:15.666
No worries,

06:16.167 --> 06:18.836
I'll have to ask Dokuga about it myself.

06:19.712 --> 06:21.547
Over our dead bodies you freak!

06:22.048 --> 06:25.051
Oh yeah? Just try to stop me
you bastards!

06:30.848 --> 06:31.808
There it is!

06:32.308 --> 06:33.393
I can feel it...

06:33.893 --> 06:35.937
Your murderous intent!

06:42.944 --> 06:45.863
Just as I thought, no guards at this
entrance.

06:48.699 --> 06:51.661
That part-time job for Tanba paid off
after all.

06:53.079 --> 06:55.039
Alright, time to find Risu.

07:04.298 --> 07:05.133
Dokuga...

07:05.633 --> 07:07.760
What are you going to do about Natsuki?

07:08.302 --> 07:11.222
If we don't act, she could be
killed, just like Risu was.

07:12.723 --> 07:14.225
Natsuki might get killed?

07:14.725 --> 07:16.394
What are they talking about?

07:18.604 --> 07:19.439
I mean-

07:19.522 --> 07:22.066
how long until the boss decides he wants
her magic?

07:22.150 --> 07:23.860
Natsuki has Magic?

07:23.943 --> 07:27.113
You're not just gonna sit back and watch
him take it, are you?!

07:27.196 --> 07:29.782
We have to stop him!
We need to figure out some way to-

07:29.866 --> 07:31.534
I'm thinking about giving Natsuki a
mission.

07:31.617 --> 07:34.203
- Uh-
- Something to keep her far away from here.

07:35.163 --> 07:37.165
I'll talk to the boss while she's gone.

07:40.877 --> 07:43.796
I'll ask him... not to kill any more
companions.

07:46.632 --> 07:47.467
Tetsujo...

07:49.594 --> 07:50.803
I'm trying so hard,

07:51.679 --> 07:53.514
I want to believe in the boss again...

07:55.308 --> 07:56.142
Dokuga...

08:00.897 --> 08:03.399
No one cared about some worthless
humans like us

08:03.483 --> 08:04.650
except him.

08:06.486 --> 08:08.738
When our only option was to lay
down and die,

08:09.238 --> 08:11.073
he gave us a path to keep living.

08:14.160 --> 08:16.245
Hey... You're right, Dokuga.

08:17.455 --> 08:18.539
Let's trust the boss.

08:20.082 --> 08:21.792
I'm sure he'll do the right thing.

08:28.758 --> 08:31.052
This whole area was En's private space.

08:31.552 --> 08:34.180
This is where my bedroom was. Kikurage's
too.

08:34.680 --> 08:35.681
I see.

08:36.349 --> 08:38.851
Maybe the room we're looking for
is nearby.

08:38.935 --> 08:40.311
Who are these guys?

08:40.853 --> 08:42.980
This area is off-limits to non-officers.

08:43.064 --> 08:44.232
Let me handle this.

08:44.982 --> 08:48.194
Hmm...
I feel like I'm remembering something...

08:48.277 --> 08:49.111
You two.

08:49.820 --> 08:50.905
Show me your arms!

08:50.988 --> 08:52.907
I need to check your smoke.

08:53.491 --> 08:56.494
I have a feeling these guys don't want us
poking around here.

08:56.577 --> 08:58.371
I bet they're Cross-Eyes officers.

08:58.871 --> 08:59.705
What do we do?

09:00.248 --> 09:02.542
Come on, hurry up and show me your arms!

09:02.625 --> 09:05.253
Use this as a training opportunity.
You deal with him.

09:05.336 --> 09:07.171
I'll keep searching for the book.

09:07.964 --> 09:08.798
Where'd she go?

09:10.675 --> 09:11.509
Whoa!

09:16.722 --> 09:17.557
Take that!

09:21.394 --> 09:22.853
My clothes are still heavy!

09:26.315 --> 09:27.733
I've got you now!

09:47.753 --> 09:49.088
Sorry, Dokuga...

09:49.922 --> 09:52.049
Tetsujo, you did well.

09:53.426 --> 09:54.260
Now you.

09:55.261 --> 09:56.095
Who are you?

09:57.430 --> 10:00.099
Why are Cross-Eyes fighting each other?

10:06.105 --> 10:07.106
He's fast!

10:09.275 --> 10:11.777
Screw training, this thing is gonna
get me killed!

10:33.966 --> 10:34.800
Dokuga!

10:41.641 --> 10:43.559
- Hmph.
- Damn it!

10:43.643 --> 10:44.810
You bastard!

10:45.561 --> 10:47.521
- You're getting...
-...Too cocky!

10:49.607 --> 10:50.441
Hmph!

10:55.446 --> 10:57.073
I can't waste all day fighting
these guys.

10:57.156 --> 10:58.074
Here's my chance.

10:59.325 --> 11:01.661
- Whoa!
- That hurts...

11:02.995 --> 11:03.954
Ah! You!

11:04.038 --> 11:05.331
That hurts...

11:12.713 --> 11:13.547
Hmm...

11:17.385 --> 11:19.887
What the hell have you been working on
over there?

11:20.471 --> 11:22.306
It's Caiman's medical record.

11:22.848 --> 11:23.849
Looking it over,

11:24.350 --> 11:27.603
you can clearly see that deep
down, Caiman is human.

11:28.354 --> 11:32.024
But there's a little abnormality
that's caught my attention.

11:33.109 --> 11:35.111
Well, Caiman is a victim of Magic,

11:35.611 --> 11:38.656
it's only natural there'd be a few
things that are out of place.

11:38.739 --> 11:40.866
That's not what I'm talking about.

11:41.409 --> 11:42.660
How should I put it...

11:45.371 --> 11:49.041
I wish I could talk this over with Mr.
Kasukabe.

11:49.875 --> 11:51.085
If I'm right about this,

11:51.585 --> 11:55.172
we may have found the reason why Caiman's
head regenerates.

11:57.550 --> 12:01.178
I can't believe it's already been a whole
month since then.

12:02.304 --> 12:06.475
I wonder what happened to Caiman
and Nikaido.

12:08.018 --> 12:13.399
QUESTION & ANSWER

12:15.860 --> 12:17.695
He must've come this way to escape.

12:18.529 --> 12:20.781
Damn it! Looks like we lost him.

12:20.865 --> 12:22.408
I hate big houses.

12:22.908 --> 12:25.619
More importantly, Dokuga, are you okay?

12:26.370 --> 12:27.204
Yeah...

12:28.539 --> 12:30.916
I bet he's at the connecting passage.
Let's go!

12:34.795 --> 12:35.629
All right,

12:35.713 --> 12:37.840
it looks like we managed to shake them
off.

12:37.923 --> 12:39.467
Who the hell are you?

12:39.550 --> 12:43.137
Why do I have to hide together with
a damn Cross-Eye?

12:44.805 --> 12:47.933
Come on, you're gonna be in as
much trouble as me if they find

12:48.017 --> 12:50.770
you here. That's it! I remember now!

12:50.853 --> 12:52.146
It's the stone statue!

12:53.022 --> 12:55.399
Huh, En really thought this through.

12:55.483 --> 12:58.110
He knew no one would wanna mess with a
devil statue.

12:59.278 --> 13:00.946
If I remember correctly...

13:02.198 --> 13:05.075
Are you sure it's okay to treat a
devil statue like that?

13:06.952 --> 13:07.787
Ah!

13:09.455 --> 13:10.331
Oh wow...

13:10.414 --> 13:13.459
I found it! The entrance to En's
treasure room!

13:14.376 --> 13:15.336
You get in too.

13:15.836 --> 13:17.671
Hide in there until things cool down.

13:17.755 --> 13:19.507
What?! Why do I have to?!

13:19.590 --> 13:22.426
- I'm busy. Whoa, woah, woah!
- Just get... in... the room!

13:27.014 --> 13:27.848
Huh?

13:29.183 --> 13:31.477
What the hell is this place?

13:32.353 --> 13:35.564
This is a top secret room that En
filled with his most cherished

13:35.648 --> 13:36.482
treasures.

13:37.107 --> 13:38.901
Cherished treasures, eh?

13:38.984 --> 13:40.653
Look like a bunch of junk to me.

13:41.487 --> 13:43.531
Also, you haven't told me who you are!

13:43.614 --> 13:45.491
You've been acting like you know me!

13:45.574 --> 13:46.659
Oh!

13:46.742 --> 13:48.327
I thought you'd noticed by now.

13:48.911 --> 13:51.080
It's me silly! I'm Nikaido!

13:51.622 --> 13:54.792
I used magic to disguise myself as
a man to sneak in here.

13:54.875 --> 13:55.960
What?!

13:57.127 --> 13:59.171
You're telling me you're Nikaido?!

13:59.755 --> 14:01.799
You know, now that you mention it...

14:02.716 --> 14:05.094
Just kidding, I'm not falling for that
bullshit.

14:05.177 --> 14:06.178
Ah...

14:06.262 --> 14:08.514
- Ugh...
- Hey, you're hurt pretty bad.

14:09.348 --> 14:11.100
Don't worry. It's nothing serious.

14:11.600 --> 14:13.561
All right, gotta find this book.

14:13.644 --> 14:14.645
Huh?!

14:16.188 --> 14:18.190
Man, I'm hungry.

14:19.316 --> 14:22.444
Oh, that's right.
I'll eat the curry bread that I brought.

14:22.528 --> 14:26.824
TO EN, CHIDARUMA A LUCKY DAY IN MARCH

14:26.907 --> 14:29.326
I only met you for the first time
the other day.

14:31.996 --> 14:33.622
I mean, even if you are Nikaido,

14:34.331 --> 14:36.166
- Hm?
- Here it is. This has to be it!

14:36.250 --> 14:37.084
What's that?

14:38.043 --> 14:40.588
You came all this way just to steal a
stupid book?

14:41.297 --> 14:42.131
Yeah.

14:42.214 --> 14:46.093
This book contains all the information I
need to master my powers...

14:49.680 --> 14:51.974
Ah! Oh crap! It's nine o'clock!

15:07.823 --> 15:08.657
See...

15:09.199 --> 15:10.034
I... told you

15:14.788 --> 15:15.789
Nikaido...

15:18.167 --> 15:19.043
Caiman...

15:21.045 --> 15:26.342
I told you a million times, I'm not this
"Caiman" guy you keep talking about.

15:26.425 --> 15:27.927
Jeez, you're annoying!

15:28.469 --> 15:32.222
I guess, I did name you "Caiman"
without much thought about it.

15:33.057 --> 15:33.891
But still...

15:33.974 --> 15:36.310
You're telling me when you transformed
back

15:36.393 --> 15:38.979
you forgot about me, the Hole, the gyoza?

15:40.189 --> 15:41.023
Gyoza...

15:42.191 --> 15:44.443
Stop it! I don't know anything
about gyoza!

15:45.235 --> 15:47.404
I heard the officers are fighting
a monster in this wing!

15:47.488 --> 15:49.156
- Oh.
- Hurry.

15:49.239 --> 15:51.116
- Let's take a look!
- What's going on?

15:53.869 --> 15:54.995
Everyone, back off!

15:55.579 --> 15:57.539
It's dangerous! Get back!

15:57.623 --> 15:59.166
Damn it. How pathetic.

15:59.708 --> 16:01.835
We can't attack Curse from our side.

16:02.336 --> 16:04.755
We need to think of something
to chase him away.

16:05.839 --> 16:06.674
Maybe...

16:06.757 --> 16:09.259
- we have to let him talk to Dokuga.
- Wait, please!

16:10.010 --> 16:12.096
I'll use my Magic to deal with him!

16:12.179 --> 16:13.931
Please, everyone, stay back!

16:14.014 --> 16:15.641
- Natsuki!
- Ah!

16:16.141 --> 16:17.643
That's Natsuki!

16:19.103 --> 16:21.605
What's that black thing over there?

16:23.065 --> 16:24.066
Don't be reckless.

16:24.149 --> 16:26.860
Natsuki, that cursed bastard never gives
up!

16:27.987 --> 16:28.821
Wait.

16:28.904 --> 16:30.114
- Wow!
- I can't believe it.

16:30.197 --> 16:31.824
- Since when can she use Magic?
- It's Magic!

16:31.907 --> 16:33.534
- Magic?!
- Isn't she a Cross-Eye?

16:43.210 --> 16:44.294
If it comes down to it,

16:44.378 --> 16:46.046
we are not going to let her die!

16:47.172 --> 16:48.173
I feel it...

16:48.257 --> 16:49.591
I can feel it...

16:50.384 --> 16:52.386
Your murderous intent!

17:05.399 --> 17:06.233
Risu!

17:26.128 --> 17:28.172
- Hey, Nikaido!
- Oh, Asu!

17:28.255 --> 17:29.256
So there you are.

17:29.757 --> 17:30.966
I've caught him!

17:31.050 --> 17:32.801
Alright, way to go Natsuki!

17:32.885 --> 17:33.886
You're amazing!

17:33.969 --> 17:35.262
What should we do?

17:35.345 --> 17:36.805
We're gonna hang him outside!

17:40.976 --> 17:41.810
- What?
- Oh! Hey?!

17:41.894 --> 17:42.728
Wait, that guy...

17:43.645 --> 17:45.647
What's wrong? What's all this commotion?

17:46.231 --> 17:47.066
Dokuga!

17:47.149 --> 17:49.401
Risu turned into Curse and attacked us
again!

17:50.402 --> 17:51.904
- What?!
- It's okay!

17:51.987 --> 17:54.698
Natsuki was able to take him
straight down!

17:54.782 --> 17:58.327
We found out that her Magic can totally
defend against curses!

18:02.331 --> 18:03.540
Natsuki, come with us.

18:03.624 --> 18:04.458
Huh?!

18:04.541 --> 18:06.210
Wait. Why?

18:07.753 --> 18:09.713
Risu! Hey! Risu!

18:16.887 --> 18:17.721
- Oh!
- Risu!

18:17.805 --> 18:20.307
- Get a hold of yourself!
- So, wait, Risu was that monster

18:20.390 --> 18:21.934
- Hey, Risu! Risu!
- from earlier?

18:22.017 --> 18:22.851
- Nikaido,
- Ah.

18:22.935 --> 18:23.852
We've got the book.

18:23.936 --> 18:25.145
Time to get out of here.

18:25.229 --> 18:26.313
Oh, right.

18:27.147 --> 18:28.565
Hey, aren't you...

18:28.649 --> 18:29.691
It's Kawajiri.

18:29.775 --> 18:31.318
Been a while, Aikawa.

18:32.861 --> 18:35.405
Aikawa. Let's get out of here together.

18:36.907 --> 18:38.534
Sorry but... I can't...

18:39.451 --> 18:40.869
Go on without me.

18:43.330 --> 18:44.957
Please, take care of him...

18:45.707 --> 18:47.167
He's my Partner.

18:47.918 --> 18:49.336
So, Risu is your Partner?

18:49.837 --> 18:51.004
Now I understand.

18:52.089 --> 18:53.257
Got it. Leave it to me.

18:53.757 --> 18:55.425
But what are you going to do?

18:55.926 --> 18:59.179
You've been hiding so many things from me
since the very beginning.

18:59.263 --> 19:00.347
What's going on?

19:00.931 --> 19:02.683
If you could only remember what we-

19:03.934 --> 19:04.768
Oh...

19:06.395 --> 19:07.688
What's wrong? Are you okay?

19:07.771 --> 19:08.730
Don't come near me!

19:10.691 --> 19:11.859
Don't come near me!

19:13.735 --> 19:17.072
I know it's your life, and you can
live it however you want... just...

19:17.823 --> 19:19.908
You should come eat some gyoza some time.

19:21.034 --> 19:22.744
I'll give you twenty percent off.

19:24.246 --> 19:25.873
I can't... anymore...

19:27.040 --> 19:27.875
I can't...

19:28.667 --> 19:29.501
Oh!

19:30.169 --> 19:31.753
Nikaido, let's go!

19:32.921 --> 19:33.881
Oh Caiman...

19:46.101 --> 19:47.019
I'm sick of it...

19:48.604 --> 19:49.605
My head!

19:50.105 --> 19:52.524
Ahhh! I'm sick of it...

20:07.289 --> 20:08.373
I'm sick of it...

20:13.170 --> 20:14.129
Why fight it?

20:18.467 --> 20:19.468
Shut up...

20:19.968 --> 20:21.637
When from the very start...

20:30.479 --> 20:32.439
you never existed.

21:40.215 --> 21:42.801
Yay! A mission, a mission!

21:43.760 --> 21:47.306
I can't believe Dokuga is letting me
do a job all by myself.

21:50.100 --> 21:50.934
Hmm...

21:51.018 --> 21:53.478
So it's a search for an elite Sorcerer.

21:53.562 --> 21:54.396
EN'S MANSION, DOG, CONVENIENCE STORE

21:54.479 --> 21:55.314
It's pretty far away.

21:55.397 --> 21:56.857
FOREST, TARGET

21:57.357 --> 22:00.986
I wanted the boss to at least see
my Magic before I set out.

22:03.363 --> 22:06.992
But they told to leave through
the back door so no one would notice.

22:07.492 --> 22:08.410
I wonder why?

22:13.457 --> 22:14.499
The Boss!

22:15.292 --> 22:16.293
I... I uh-

22:19.463 --> 22:21.214
Eek! I-I'm about

22:21.715 --> 22:23.300
to start a mission...!

22:24.051 --> 22:25.677
Um...! S-So I-, uh.

22:26.178 --> 22:27.679
W-When I get back,

22:27.763 --> 22:30.349
I want all the Cross-Eyes to take a
picture together-

22:30.432 --> 22:31.266
Whoa?!

22:34.144 --> 22:35.520
I want you...

22:36.688 --> 22:37.522
Oh Boss...!

22:52.829 --> 22:53.705
B-Boss...

22:55.832 --> 22:56.666
W-Why...

24:53.658 --> 24:54.951
THE END

24:55.035 --> 24:56.828
What we learned in Episode twenty-three.

24:56.912 --> 24:59.122
There was a major clue in Caiman's
medical record.

24:59.206 --> 25:01.291
Aikawa entrusted Risu to Nikaido.

25:01.374 --> 25:03.627
Natsuki wanted to take a picture with
everyone.

25:03.710 --> 25:05.670
What we're going to learn in Episode
twenty-four.

25:05.754 --> 25:07.714
It's still... lost in chaos.

25:07.797 --> 25:09.716
This is Dorohedoro!
